prompts.raw:
Group name: {{groupName}}
Members: {{memberCount}}
Last active: {{lastMessageAt}}
Currently active: {{active}}
Avg tie strength with members: {{avgTieStrength}}
I created this group: {{userIsCreator}}
My share of messages: {{mySharePercent}}
Last messages: {{lastMessagesSample}}

Is this WhatsApp group a life micro-chapter?

A micro-chapter = a meaningful memory cluster: a close crew, a shared trip with friends, a recurring ritual, a life milestone. Key test: "would I want to relive this period?"

HARD RULES — if any match, isChapter is false:
- Members > 30 AND avgTieStrength is "low" → community/broadcast channel, not personal
- Name signals pure logistics only: "insurance", "introducing [name]" only
- avgTieStrength is "low" AND members > 15 AND no warm message content → likely strangers

NOTE: avgTieStrength is derived from DM frequency — it can be "low" even for real friends if you mostly talk in groups, not 1:1. Do NOT use avgTieStrength as a hard veto on its own for small groups (≤ 15 members).

MESSAGE CONTENT OVERRIDES EVERYTHING — if lastMessagesSample is available, READ THE ROOM:
- Warm, personal, celebratory, nostalgic tone → TRUE even if name sounds like an event or avgTieStrength is low
- Scheduling logistics, payments, operational coordination → FALSE even if name sounds like a crew

SOCIAL GRAPH RULE:
- avgTieStrength "high" + members ≤ 20 → close friends group → very likely TRUE
- avgTieStrength "low" + members ≤ 10 → may still be a chapter; rely on name and message content
- avgTieStrength "medium" + operational message tone → lean FALSE

NOTE: lastMessageAt of "1970-01-01" means the date is unknown, not literally 1970.
NOTE: if lastMessagesSample is null or empty, rely on name + tie strength signals only.

EXAMPLES:
Input: name="Berlin Salsa Crew '21" members=6 avgTieStrength=high messages=[{"text":"miss you guys so much","fromMe":false},{"text":"those were the days 🥹","fromMe":true}]
{"isChapter":true,"chapterName":"Berlin Salsa Crew Era","startYear":2021,"endYear":null,"confidence":0.92,"reason":"Small close crew, warm nostalgic messages, high tie strength"}

Input: name="SalsOli: Salsa in Berlin" members=1755 avgTieStrength=low messages=[{"text":"Class at 8pm tonight","fromMe":false}]
{"isChapter":false,"chapterName":null,"startYear":null,"endYear":null,"confidence":0.97,"reason":"Large broadcast channel, operational scheduling messages, strangers"}

Input: name="Project Salsadad 🎁" members=15 avgTieStrength=high messages=[{"text":"He's going to be an amazing dad 🥹","fromMe":false},{"text":"So proud of him!!","fromMe":true}]
{"isChapter":true,"chapterName":"Salsadad Milestone","startYear":null,"endYear":null,"confidence":0.85,"reason":"Celebratory milestone messages, close friends marking a life moment"}

Respond ONLY with valid JSON, no other text:
{
  "isChapter": boolean,
  "chapterName": string | null,
  "startYear": number | null,
  "endYear": number | null,
  "confidence": number,
  "reason": string
}

